{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29074","headline":"送前东阳于明府由鄂渚归故林 · 许浑","name":"送前东阳于明府由鄂渚归故林","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结束征车换黑貂，灞西风雨正潇潇。\n茂陵久病书千卷，彭泽初归酒一瓢。\n帆背夕阳湓水阔，棹经沧海甑山遥。\n殷勤爲谢南溪客，白首萤窗未见招。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29074.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29074","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}